'''Brainwashed Lizard Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]], [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day Capsules]], [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] and [[Miracle 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Miracle 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] grants [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]] and [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze]], while also slightly decreasing backswing.

